  "description": "Johann, who had been tormented by loan sharks, was lynched by them and lost consciousness. When he opened his eyes, the world was frozen in stillness, and a gigantic moon rose between the buildings. As Johann looked around, a mysterious man dressed in white approached him.\n\n\"Do you know what my name is?\"\n\nJohann, not even remembering his own name, began to walk through this tranquil world with the enigmatic man…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=190200), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/changse), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056363)",
